<!-- Template Description -->
This template displays a forum-style list of pages using the DPLForum extension. It provides a flexible interface for showing forum topics with various display options and filtering capabilities.

==Syntax==
{{T|Forum/table|target=|count=|mode=|ordermethod=}}

==Parameters==
===Content Parameters===
* '''target''' or '''category''' - The category to display forum topics from (defaults to current page name)
* '''category1''', '''category2''', '''category3'''... - Additional categories (pages must be in ALL specified categories)
* '''notcategory''' - Exclude pages in this category
* '''notcategory1''', '''notcategory2'''... - Additional categories to exclude
* '''namespace''' - Namespace to search in (default: Forum)
* '''prefix''' - Only show pages with titles starting with this prefix
* '''start''' - Number of results to skip (for pagination)
* '''count''' - Maximum number of results to show (default: 5, max: 50)
* '''title''' - If specified, creates a forum-style link to the given page

===Display Parameters===
* '''mode''' - Output format:
** '''table''' (default) - Display as table rows
** '''list''' - Display as list items
** '''none''' - Simple line breaks
** '''count''' - Return only the number of matching entries
* '''compact''' - Combine table columns:
** '''author''' - Combine Title and Author columns
** '''editor''' - Combine Edit and Editor columns
** '''all''' - Combine both
* '''addcreationdate''' - Show creation date (true/false)
* '''addauthor''' - Show original author (true/false)
* '''addlasteditor''' - Show last editor (true/false, default: true)
* '''addlastedit''' - Show last edit time (true/false, default: true)
* '''shownamespace''' - Show namespace in titles (true/false, default: false)

===Sorting Parameters===
* '''ordermethod''' - Sort order:
** '''lastedit''' (default) - Sort by last edit time
** '''created''' - Sort by creation time
** '''pageid''' - Sort by page ID
* '''order''' - Set to "ascending" to reverse sort order
* '''historylink''' - Add history links:
** '''true''' (default) - Show history link
** '''embed''' - Replace Edit field with history link
** '''append''' - Add history link after Edit field
* '''omit''' - Text to remove from beginning of titles
* '''newdays''' - Mark entries edited within this many days as new (default: 7)
* '''timestamp''' - Include timestamps in links (true/false, default: true)
* '''cache''' - Cache results (true/false, default: false)

===UI Parameters===
* '''noresult''' - Message when no posts exist (default: "post something here")
* '''buttonlabel''' - Label for add button reference (default: "Add New Topic")

==Examples==
===Basic forum list===
{{T|Forumtable}}

===Specific category with 10 items===
{{T|Forumtable|target=General Discussion|count=10}}

===Multiple categories, exclude archives===
{{T|Forumtable|category1=Questions|category2=Unanswered|notcategory=Archive}}

===Compact display with author info===
{{T|Forumtable|compact=all|addauthor=true|addcreationdate=true}}

===List mode for custom styling===
<pre>
<ul class="custom-forum-list">
{{ForumList|mode=list|count=20}}
</ul>
</pre>

===Count topics in category===
<pre>
There are {{ForumList|mode=count|target=Help Requests}} help requests.
</pre>

===Filter by prefix, sorted by creation===
{{T|Forumtable|prefix=FAQ:|ordermethod=created|order=ascending|omit=FAQ:}}

